    reason: "the gpu.sh launcher body is transcribed from the host (read 2026-11-08 21:36 UTC) and its sha256 is relayed by the operator (c486a841...26cf); no witness has independently computed the hash. If the transcription drifted from the host file, this module would not catch it until a witness runs. The unit file was READ directly (2026-11-09) and the helper is retained verbatim (srv1_replica_helper) with its relayed sha256 e2822634...6a6d.",
    dissolution: unbound_dissolution(description: "a witness on srv1 computes sha256 of both the launcher and the helper script, and diffs each retained body against this module's copy; the parent's #16104 branch adds the router row consuming the roster. SUFFICIENT for dissolving this row."),
  ),
  frontier_row_decl(
