    dissolution: unbound_dissolution(description: "a witness on srv1 reads the PLE allocation from the process's smaps or the nvidia driver's proc entry and asserts it equals 26.8 GiB; the fleet_host_budget srv1 claim imports this row. SUFFICIENT for dissolving this row and marking the budget as independently matched."),
